implementation = "Add the eighteen exact processor, receipt and PostgreSQL-backed source failures to the reviewed package-scoped baseline with retiring task 22.39.162, retaining every indexer source, assertion and Makefile derivation."
classes = "Thirteen processor cases: foreign-key TRUNCATE refusal, disallowing connections to the current database, receipt qualification rejection, HTTP read-model mode unavailable and five inconsistent parameter $10 types (SQLSTATE 42P08); three receipt and two source cases reject receipt qualification."
suspect = "The attempt-6 tidy upgraded github.com/jackc/pgx/v5 from v5.10.0 to v5.11.0 beside the go-pglite import; this is the first suspect for the five replay parameter typing refusals, not a proven cause; the same eighteen failures occurred on PostgreSQL 16 and 18."
producer = "Preserve the root node go directive toolchain override of repair37Run and the launchpad Go 1.27.3 pin."

