seed = "This sandbox carries attempt 8 (9621d9237eec) and its 86 baseline entries, not the attempt-9 tree cited by do_11; no prior gate ledger or pnl-tracker baseline is present. Recover the eighteen indexer entries from gotcha 3646 and include pnl-tracker before the twelve remaining modules in the authorized survey, recording observed failures without inventing the missing 114 entries."
